    "Owner": "NLM",
    "CoiStatement": "CK and KMKI run perineal repair workshops both nationally and internationally and have developed an episiotomy and second-degree tear training model with Limbs and Things, UK. They receive a small royalty fee that contributes towards women's health research funds.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "e013008"},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": {
        "UI": "D016428",
